Package: rctl
Type: Package
Title: Runix Command-Line Interface
Version: 0.0.1.1
Date: 2026-08-07
Authors@R: c(
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "troy@cornball.ai",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-4248-604X")),
    person("cornball.ai", role = "cph"))
Description: The Runix command-line interface: a machine-drivable CLI over
    the Runix read-only introspection packages. In machine mode ('--json')
    it emits exactly one versioned JSON envelope per invocation, with typed
    errors carrying condition classes and retryability; human mode is
    explicitly unstable. Subsystem packages are detected at runtime, so
    capability introspection succeeds even where they are absent.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
OS_type: unix
Imports: yyjsonr (>= 0.1.22)
Suggests: jsonlite, littler, rdpkg, rsystemd, tinytest
